This is your "DETOX" from your drug! Take this very seriously. Many a man came before you and did not make it. Start praying to God for the strength to stay and to help you do this! Skimping on even one item can cause you to relapse. God will guide you and help you if you ask Him. These exercises (with Gods help), along with the other "2 Keys" will result in most men getting sober immediately, and create a firm foundation for long term sobriety. Remember, we must ask God to help us PRIORITIZE this recovery/detox FIRST in our lives to succeed- above our families, jobs, etc, everything. Rehab programs work initially simply because you are taken out of your life and MUST now solely focus on the problem of your addiction. THIS is the easier softer way! Mathew 6:33 says "Seek ye first the Kingdom of God and all its RIGHTEOUSNESS". (That means without our secret sin). Are you willing? Are you tired and desperate enough??? If we don''t take this deathly serious now and getting out of sin''s path once and for all, we will revisit this later when we are in fact locked up or utterly alone.

